
@startuml

title COLORS Web Application - Class Diagram
left to right direction

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam class {
  BackgroundColor #EFF5FC
  BorderColor #456581
  ArrowColor #52667B
  FontColor #20354A
}

hide empty methods

' Conceptual domain classes; real implementation uses procedural PHP.
class "User" as User <<domain entity>> {
  ID : Integer
  FirstName : String
  LastName : String
  Login : String
  Password : String
}

class "Color" as Color <<domain entity>> {
  ID : Integer
  Name : String
  UserID : Integer
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Color : owns >


note bottom of User
  Conceptual representation of the Users and Colors
  MySQL tables, not literal classes in the PHP code.
  Login, add, and search are procedural API functions.
end note

@enduml
